  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Swift is a very soft, round co-polyester monofilament engineered from a complex blend of six different materials processed in three manufacturing stages. It is designed to provide above-average comfort, tension stability, power and control while retaining the durability and predictability expected from a performance polyester. Its smooth round profile makes it particularly suitable for hybrid setups, and MSV recommends it for normal and dense string patterns without the need for pre-stretching. Made in Austria.",

    "zh": "MSV Swift 是一款非常柔和的圆形共聚酯单丝球线，由六种不同材料经过三阶段工艺复合制造。它的核心定位是在保持竞技型聚酯稳定性和耐久性的同时，提供更高舒适性、优秀保磅、力量以及控制表现。圆形光滑结构使其特别适合 Hybrid 混穿，同时 MSV 也推荐用于正常及密集线床，并明确表示无需预拉伸。产品产自奥地利。"
  },

